(Orbit T2 Troubleshooting Guide) Tj T*
(Lumen Home is a fictional company. Sample data for the MultiSource RAG Chatbot.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Error codes) Tj T*
(E-114  Low power. The thermostat is not getting continuous power.) Tj T*
(       Install the C-wire adapter or connect a C-wire. Random reboots are a sign.) Tj T*
(E-207  Wi-Fi connection failed. Check the password and that the router is on.) Tj T*
(       Move the router closer or use the 2.4 GHz band, which reaches further.) Tj T*
(E-310  Temperature sensor fault. Restart the thermostat from Settings > Restart.) Tj T*
(       If the error returns within a day, contact Lumen Home support.) Tj T*
(E-402  No heating detected. The system did not heat within 15 minutes.) Tj T*
(       Check the furnace switch, the breaker and the W1 wire.) Tj T*
(E-405  No cooling detected. The system did not cool within 15 minutes.) Tj T*
(       Check the outdoor unit breaker and the Y1 wire.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
