(Common problems) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The display is blank: check the breaker, then make sure the display is clipped) Tj T*
(firmly onto the base plate. Wait two minutes after power returns.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The room feels warmer than the setting: the thermostat may be in direct sunlight) Tj T*
(or above a lamp. Move it, or add a wireless room sensor and set it as primary.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The schedule is ignored: check that Hold is not active. A manual change holds) Tj T*
(until the next schedule step unless you choose Hold permanently.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Contacting support) Tj T*
(Have your serial number ready. It is in Settings > About and on the box.) Tj T*
(Support hours are 8 a.m. to 8 p.m., Monday to Saturday.) Tj T*
ET
